OL,3,GNEWSAMurder charges after man found
OL,4,Adead in property
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a man was found dead inside a
OL,8,Fproperty.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said Ian
OL,11,FDavis, 56, was found with multiple
OL,12,Finjuries at a property on Baytree Hill,
OL,13,FLiskeard, on 13 September. He was
OL,14,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,16,FThe force said four men were arrested
OL,17,Fon suspicion of murder and subsequently
OL,18,Fbailed. It said two of the men, Darrell
OL,19,FRowland, 49, from Trevarthian Road, St
OL,20,FAustell, and Sukhvinder Singh Shokur,
OL,21,F58, from Liskeard, were re-arrested and
OL,22,Fcharged with murder.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
